### 6.8 Flusso di Caricamento del Profilo

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Utente
    participant R as Angular Router
    participant G as authGuard
    participant F as Frontend (Profile)
    participant I as authInterceptor
    participant B as Backend
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>R: Naviga a /profile
    R->>G: canActivate?
    G->>G: authService.isAuthenticated()

    alt Non autenticato
        G-->>R: router.parseUrl('/login')
        R-->>U: Redirect a /login
    else Autenticato
        G-->>R: true
        R->>F: Crea istanza Profile, inserisce in router-outlet

        F->>F: ngOnInit() → fetchProfile()
        F->>I: apiService.getProfile()
        I->>I: Token presente → Aggiunge Authorization: Bearer <token>
        I->>B: GET /profile

        B->>B: requireAuth → Decodifica JWT → req.email
        B->>DB: User.findByPk(req.email)
        B->>DB: Cat.findAll({ where: { UserEmail }, limit: 10, order: DESC })
        B->>DB: Comment.findAll({ where: { UserEmail }, include: Cat, limit: 10 })

        B-->>F: 200 OK { userName, email, role, createdAt, stats, recentCats, recentComments }
        F->>F: this.user = data
        F-->>U: Mostra profilo con statistiche e attività recenti
    end
```

